Add tab keyboard support? Optional. Let's implement small:
```js
const tabs=$$('.mat-tab');
tabs.forEach((tab,i)=>tab.addEventListener('keydown', e=>{
 if(e.key!=='ArrowLeft'&&e.key!=='ArrowRight') return;
 e.preventDefault();
 const next=tabs[(i+(e.key==='ArrowRight'?1:tabs.length-1))%tabs.length];
 next.focus(); setSheet(next.dataset.sheet);
}));
```
Need role tab and aria-selected; yes. Add.

Also focus styles for tab: `:focus-visible` global. Good.

Add in init after tab listeners.

input.newString:
const materialTabs = $$('.mat-tab');
materialTabs.forEach((tab, index) => {
  tab.addEventListener('click', () => setSheet(tab.dataset.sheet));
  tab.addEventListener('keydown', (event) => {
    if (event.key !== 'ArrowLeft' && event.key !== 'ArrowRight') return;
    event.preventDefault();
    const target = materialTabs[(index + (event.key === 'ArrowRight' ? 1 : materialTabs.length - 1)) % materialTabs.length];
    target.focus();
    setSheet(target.dataset.sheet);
  });
});

